[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は君たちの身に危険があれば助けるようにと\n母様から命じられていたのだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother tasked me to help you if you were ever in danger."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、下がって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, get back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "君たちに危害を加えるつもりはないんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I have no intention of harming you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むしろ君たちの代わりを連れて来たんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In fact, I've brought substitutes for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "代わり……って、どういうことっすか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Substitutes...? What do you mean?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ……？\u3000そちらの方々は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...? Who are those people...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつらはランターナにいた山賊どもだ。\n今は眠らせてある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These are bandits from Lantarna. They're unconscious right now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつらを身代わりにここから出ろ。選ばれた人間\nである君たちが、こんな所に囚われる道理はない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Use them as substitutes and get out of here. There's no reason for chosen people like you to be trapped in a place like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっ、そんなのダメですよ！\nその人たちは関係ないじゃないですか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no! That's wrong! Those people have nothing to do with this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気にする必要はない、ただの罪人だ。\nここで本に閉じ込められるだけのことをしてきた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no need to worry about mere criminals. They've done enough to deserve being trapped in this book."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たとえ罪人だとしても、\n国の法によって正しく裁かれるべきです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if they are criminals, they should be judged properly by the kingdom's laws."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それを私たちが勝手に決めることはできない。\nましてや、使い捨てていい命なんかじゃないんです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can't decide that on our own. And their lives aren't something we can just throw away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なぜ罪人にまで情けをかけるのか分からないな。\nまったく……話に聞く以上に聞き分けが悪いようだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't understand why you show mercy even to criminals. You're even more stubborn than I was told."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仕方あるまい。聞き分けのない悪い子には、\n少々お灸を据えてやらないといけないらしい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It can't be helped. Disobedient children need to be taught a lesson, it seems."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "退く気はなさそうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Doesn't look like he's backing down."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あぁ。話は平行線のようだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. We're at an impasse."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ！\u3000やろう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! Let's do this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]